变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"已核对陈述、原书两种证明的依赖及用 Lemma 1 的短推导；保留第二不完备性上游核验限制"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 具有固定原始递归公理呈示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 和一致性分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a>；固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,v\">\\(z,v\\)</span> 是各异的算术变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\)</span>，并满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,g[T])\">\\(\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,g[T])\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,D,\\gamma\">\\(g,D,\\gamma\\)</span>；要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\\)</span> 且满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau)\\)</span>。这些是对所选内部公理数值化的前提，不由逐数双表示条件单独推出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" href=\"?note=9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" title=\"67-lem-pi1-interpretation\">67-lem-pi1-interpretation</a> 的接口；第二不完备性所用条件按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"87f4e115bf0f1121\" href=\"?note=87f4e115bf0f1121\" title=\"67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness\">67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness</a> 的 BL 接口展开，其对当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau\\)</span> 的应用取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"407cbcc3fb925fed\" href=\"?note=407cbcc3fb925fed\" title=\"67-thm-lob\">67-thm-lob</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\neg(0=0)\">\\(\\varphi=\\neg(0=0)\\)</span> 实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr)\n\\ \\land\\\n\\neg\\bigl(Q\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr)\n\\ \\land\\\n\\neg\\bigl(Q\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\}\\unlhd T\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由前两节的复杂度条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\unlhd T\">\\(Q+\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\unlhd T\\)</span>，Π1 解释引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\)</span>。该句在经典逻辑中等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(\\overline{g(\\neg(0=0))})\\to\\neg(0=0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(\\overline{g(\\neg(0=0))})\\to\\neg(0=0)\\)</span>，由显式 BL 条件和 Löb 定理推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg(0=0)\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg(0=0)\\)</span>，与一致性矛盾。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\unlhd T\">\\(T+\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\unlhd T\\)</span>，限制源公理即得到前一种解释。</p>\n<p>这里区分“公理的逐数双表示”和“满足 BL 且具有所需句法复杂度的内部可证性公式”，不再用未展开的“原书标准数值化”承担关键条件。来源页码及既往核验记录沿用输入档案，本轮未重新核验原书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-lem-pi1-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"9dc79b4dfd8280cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-lem-pi1-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-graph-interface","status":"resolved","id":"f115352299e944bf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arith